      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be even better if the influence of each bone by grab could be set graphically. (I would like to set the influence and the range of bones that can be grabbed separately if possible)\nIt would be more stable if areas with grab 0 could not be grabbed individually.\n各ボーンのgrabによる影響力をグラフで設定できればさらに良いと思います。（できれば影響力とボーンを掴める範囲を別に設定したいです）\ngrab0のエリアは個別にグラブ出来ないようにすれば、安定度が高まります。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
